message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Chronic Disease Risk Prediction Skills: Reproducible Agent Skills Packages on US National Survey Data"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "bellawang2024"
    email: "wangweilu7120@163.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bellawang2024/chronic-disease-risk-skills"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - risk prediction
  - machine learning
  - xgboost
  - public health
  - epidemiology
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Agent Skills packages for chronic disease risk prediction, built entirely on
  US government public-domain survey data.
  NHIS 2016-2025, BRFSS 2017, NHANES 2017-2018
  Every model is reproducible byte-for-byte from official raw files and
  ships with a full data provenance document covering checksums, variable
  harmonisation, label rules and limitations.
  For research and educational use only - not for clinical decision-making.
